<title>UK: Imperial Tobacco gains on dawn raid talk.</title>
<headline>Imperial Tobacco gains on dawn raid talk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Imperial Tobacco Plc rose in early trading on Thursday after a report in the Financial Times said there was market speculation of a dawn raid on the company.</p>
<p>The stock, which started trading on Tuesday after being demerged from conglomerate Hanson Plc, was up 8-1/2p at 412-1/2 by 0705 GMT.</p>
</text>
